  the statement constructs a solution.
* Theorem 5.2's two matrix bounds hold for any finite slot type (the statements are generic in `S`); the two weighted
  bounds use the slot distance and are stated on `Slot δ₀ T`. "With the same matrix `M^Ψ` for any interaction obtained
  from `Ψ` by setting some of its terms to zero" is stated for every `Ψ'` with `Ψ'(Z) ∈ {Ψ(Z), 0}` for all `Z`, with the
